msgid ""
"All required tools are available on `OSGeoLive <http://live.osgeo.org>`__."
msgstr "必要なツールはすべて `OSGeoLive <http://live.osgeo.org>`__ で入手できます。"

#: ../../build/docs/general-intro/osgeolive.rst:15
